      "id": "claim_bf9b2f0192834c23a57b67286fde71a7",
      "statement": "The `ulabase.setup.ts` script provides declarative setup for the accounts side of the service: installs the `accounts` plugin, sets the `branding` feature's `name` to `APP_NAME` (env `APP_NAME`, default 'Ulabase Starter') while preserving console-set color/logo, configures `frontend-url`/`frontend-app-url` and derives the server's `features` toggles from `environment.dev.ts`, sets Google OAuth credentials if the app offers Google, adds the app origin to the `origin-allowlist`, and finally points `environment.dev.ts` `apiUrl` at the service via `appPointsAtService`.",
